/**
 * @mainpage Keyple Common C++ API
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * The **Keyple Common C++ API** contains the interfaces of the objects that
 * are involved in the public interactions between different Keyple components,
 * providing the foundation for component communication.
 *
 * @section key_features Key Features
 *
 * - Common interfaces for Keyple components
 * - Plugin and reader extension points
 * - Standard component interaction contracts
 * - Base API for Keyple architecture
 * - Cross-component communication interfaces
 *
 * @section resources Resources
 *
 * - **Documentation**: [keyple.org](https://keyple.org)
 * - **API Documentation**: [docs.keyple.org/keyple-common-cpp-api](https://docs.keyple.org/keyple-common-cpp-api)
 */
